          "description": "<p>You unleash a swirling multitude of colors that overwhelms creatures based on their Will saves.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Stunned 1, Blinded for 1 round, and dazzled for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is stunned for 1 round and blinded for 1 minute.</p>",
